===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Brilliant Stars|Impidimp|92}} from the {{TCG|Brilliant Stars}} expansion; both cards have the Bite attack.
*{{m|Bite}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Impidimp}} can learn.
